          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23000' id='35' type-v2='text' w='31818' x='1091' y='75625'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Segoe UI'>KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Total Sales reached 411.79M with 131.28M Gross Profit and a 31.88% Profit Margin.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Electronics generated the highest category sales at 97.35M, followed by Grocery at 90.99M.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• North America is the strongest region with 191.01M sales, while Europe generated 158.53M.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Top profitable product types include Fiction, Non-Fiction, Water, Shoes, and T-shirt.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Monthly sales remained relatively stable at around 33–35M, indicating consistent business performance.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23000' id='36' type-v2='text' w='38909' x='33091' y='75625'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Segoe UI'>BUSINESS RECOMMENDATIONS</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Prioritize high-margin categories such as Books while maintaining strong sales categories like Electronics and Grocery.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Focus marketing and sales strategies on high-performing regions, especially North America and Europe.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Promote high-profit product types and review low-profit products for pricing and cost optimization.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Maintain adequate inventory for consistently performing products and reduce excess stock of slow-moving items.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Monitor inventory days against profitability to improve inventory turnover and reduce holding costs.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI'>• Use seasonal and monthly sales trends to optimize purchasing, stock levels.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='23375' id='37' name='Sheet 12' w='26909' x='72091' y='75375'>
